        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>业绩综述 — 寿险及健康险业务</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #231f20;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1240px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 48px 74px 30px 84px;\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 1754px;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n  .title-main {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    color: #231f20;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .title-sub {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    color: #F26522;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    margin: 4px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Tables ---------- */\n  table.data {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin-top: 0;\n  }\n  table.data th, table.data td {\n    padding: 7px 0;\n    vertical-align: bottom;\n  }\n  table.data thead th {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #d9d9d9;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .col-item { text-align: left; width: 46%; }\n  .col-y1 { text-align: right; width: 20%; }\n  .col-y2 { text-align: right; width: 17%; }\n  .col-ch { text-align: right; width: 17%; }\n  .hdr-orange { color: #F26522; font-weight: 400; }\n  .hdr-cur { color: #231f20; font-weight: 700; }\n  .hdr-prev { color: #7f7f7f; font-weight: 400; }\n  .hdr-chg { color: #7f7f7f; font-weight: 400; }\n  table.data tbody td { border-bottom: 1px solid #ebebeb; }\n  table.data tbody tr.section td {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #ebebeb;\n  }\n  td.bold-num { font-weight: 700; }\n  td.plain-num { font-weight: 400; }\n  sup { font-size: 9px; vertical-align: super; }\n  .note {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #231f20;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    margin: 8px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  .note-indent { padding-left: 2.1em; }\n  /* ---------- Two column body ---------- */\n  .body-cols {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 46px;\n    margin-top: 62px;\n  }\n  .col-left { flex: 0 0 700px; }\n  .col-right { flex: 1 1 auto; }\n  h3.orange {\n    color: #F26522;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  ul.bul {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0 0 0 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  ul.bul > li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n    line-height: 2.05;\n  }\n  ul.bul > li::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 12px;\n    width: 9px;\n    height: 9px;\n    border: 1.5px solid #F26522;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle, #F26522 0 2px, transparent 2px);\n  }\n  p.plain { margin: 0 0 2px 0; line-height: 2.05; padding-left: 20px; }\n  p.indent1 { margin: 0; line-height: 2.05; padding-left: 20px; text-indent: 1.6em; }\n  /* ---------- KPI blocks ---------- */\n  .kpi { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .kpi .num {\n    color: #F26522;\n    font-size: 44px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    letter-spacing: 0px;\n  }\n  .kpi .num .unit { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; }\n  .kpi .num .pre { font-size: 20px; color: #231f20; font-weight: 400; }\n  .kpi .rule {\n    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #F26522;\n    margin: 6px 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .kpi .label {\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #231f20;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .kpi-2 { margin-top: 300px; }\n  .kpi-3 { margin-top: 46px; }\n  /* ---------- lower sections ---------- */\n  .para-full {\n    margin-top: 40px;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    line-height: 2.05;\n  }\n  h4.sec {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 42px 0 4px 0;\n    color: #231f20;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 84px;\n    right: 74px;\n    bottom: 26px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n  }\n  .footer .left { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; }\n  .footer .pageno { font-size: 22px; color: #7f7f7f; }\n  .footer .orange { color: #F26522; font-weight: 700; }\n  .footer .right { color: #7f7f7f; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title-main\">业绩综述</h1>\n  <h2 class=\"title-sub\">寿险及健康险业务</h2>\n\n  <div style=\"height:170px\"></div>\n\n  <table class=\"data\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"col-item hdr-orange\">（人民币百万元）</th>\n        <th class=\"col-y1 hdr-cur\">2024年</th>\n        <th class=\"col-y2 hdr-prev\">2023年</th>\n        <th class=\"col-ch hdr-chg\">变动(%)</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"section\">\n        <td>代理人产能及收入</td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>代理人渠道新业务价值<sup>(1)</sup></td>\n        <td class=\"col-y1 bold-num\">31,870</td>\n        <td class=\"col-y2 plain-num\">25,187</td>\n        <td class=\"col-ch plain-num\">26.5</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>代理人人均新业务价值<sup>(1)</sup>（元／人均每年）</td>\n        <td class=\"col-y1 bold-num\">101,271</td>\n        <td class=\"col-y2 plain-num\">70,689</td>\n        <td class=\"col-ch plain-num\">43.3</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>代理人活动率<sup>(2)</sup>(%)</td>\n        <td class=\"col-y1 bold-num\">52.8</td>\n        <td class=\"col-y2 plain-num\">53.3</td>\n        <td class=\"col-ch plain-num\">下降0.5个百分点</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>代理人收入（元／人均每月）</td>\n        <td class=\"col-y1 bold-num\">10,395</td>\n        <td class=\"col-y2 plain-num\">9,813</td>\n        <td class=\"col-ch plain-num\">5.9</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>其中：寿险收入（元／人均每月）</td>\n        <td class=\"col-y1 bold-num\">8,227</td>\n        <td class=\"col-y2 plain-num\">7,402</td>\n        <td class=\"col-ch plain-num\">11.1</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <p class=\"note\">注：(1)　当期及去年同期的新业务价值基于2023年末的长期投资回报率假设(4.5%)和风险贴现率假设(9.5%)计算。</p>\n  <p class=\"note note-indent\">(2)　代理人活动率＝当年各月出单代理人数量之和／当年各月在职代理人数量之和。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"body-cols\">\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <h3 class=\"orange\">银保渠道</h3>\n      <ul class=\"bul\">\n        <li>聚焦价值经营，高质量发展成效显著。2024年，银保渠道新业务价值同比增长62.7%。</li>\n        <li>深化 “5+5+N” 策略，与5大国有行深化合作，全面拓展5家全国性股份行合作，并挖掘N家潜力城商行寻求增量；扩充优质合作网点，落实标准化网点经营动作，提升经营效能。</li>\n        <li>强化队伍绩优建设，提升队伍专业能力和产能。</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h3 class=\"orange\" style=\"margin-top:34px;\">社区金融服务及其他渠道</h3>\n      <p class=\"plain\" style=\"text-indent:0;\">社区金融服务渠道方面，平安寿险持续推广社区金融服务经营模式，网点和队伍保持高质量发展，客户经营价值持续突破。</p>\n      <ul class=\"bul\" style=\"margin-top:2px;\">\n        <li>价值方面，2024年，存续客户<sup>(1)</sup>13个月保单继续率同比提升5.7个百分点，新业务价值同比提升近300%。</li>\n        <li>网点方面，截至2024年末，已在93个城市铺设131个网点，较年初增加42城66个网点。</li>\n        <li>队伍方面，截至2024年末，已组建近2.4万人的高素质、高绩效、高品质的 “三高” 精英队伍。</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:34px; padding-left:26px;\">注：(1)　存续客户指与平安寿险终止代理关系的代理人在代理关系终止之前，其所代理销售的有效保单</p>\n      <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:0; padding-left:26px; text-indent:3.4em;\">客户。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <div class=\"kpi\">\n        <div class=\"num\">62.7<span class=\"unit\">%</span></div>\n        <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n        <div class=\"label\">银保渠道新业务价值同比增长</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"kpi kpi-2\">\n        <div class=\"num\">131<span class=\"unit\">个</span></div>\n        <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n        <div class=\"label\">已在93个城市铺设网点数</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"kpi kpi-3\">\n        <div class=\"num\"><span class=\"pre\">近</span>2.4<span class=\"unit\">万</span></div>\n        <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n        <div class=\"label\">已组建 “三高” 精英队伍人数</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"para-full\">下沉渠道方面，2024年平安寿险持续在7个省份推进销售，创新并迭代业务模式，逐步探索形成稳定的产能路径。</p>\n\n  <h4 class=\"sec\">个人寿险销售代理人数量</h4>\n\n  <table class=\"data\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"col-item hdr-orange\">平安寿险</th>\n        <th class=\"col-y1 hdr-cur\">2024年12月31日</th>\n        <th class=\"col-y2 hdr-prev\">2023年12月31日</th>\n        <th class=\"col-ch hdr-chg\">变动(%)</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>个人寿险销售代理人数量（万人）</td>\n        <td class=\"col-y1 bold-num\">36.3</td>\n        <td class=\"col-y2 plain-num\">34.7</td>\n        <td class=\"col-ch plain-num\">4.6</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <p class=\"note\">注：个人寿险销售代理人数量指与平安寿险公司签订代理保险业务合同的人员数量，含代理人渠道、银保渠道、社区金融服务及其他渠道。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"left\">\n      <span class=\"pageno\">32</span>\n      <span class=\"orange\">二零二四年年报</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"right\">中国平安保险（集团）股份有限公司</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
